# Phase two — lead capture via a Google Apps Script Web App bound to the
# Leads spreadsheet. The script appends the row and emails Kirra Dive itself
# with MailApp, so there's no Google service-account key and no separate
# email provider to configure. See apps-script/README.md to deploy it.
# Set these as Vercel environment variables; never commit real values or
# expose them with a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix — they're read only inside the
# server-side route handlers under app/api/leads/.

# LEADS_APPS_SCRIPT_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/XXXXXXXXXXXX/exec
# LEADS_APPS_SCRIPT_SECRET=

# Public site URL used for metadata / Open Graph.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://kirradive.com.au
